{
  "date": "2026-11-13",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "证监会：今年上市公司回购创新高，将进一步稳定股市",
  "title_en": "CSRC: Share buybacks by listed companies hit a record this year; it will do more to keep the stock market stable",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月12日，2026年上海证券交易所国际投资者大会在上海举行。中国证监会有关负责人在会上发言，介绍了稳定股票市场的一些做法。",
      "en": "On November 12, the 2026 Shanghai Stock Exchange International Investor Conference was held in Shanghai. An official from the China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) spoke at the meeting and described some of the steps taken to keep the stock market stable."
    },
    {
      "zh": "这位负责人说，证监会和其他部门一起，使用了央行的两项结构性货币政策工具。到现在，证券公司和基金公司已经做了第三批“互换便利”操作，金额为1000亿元，用来支持上市公司回购和增持自己的股票。互换便利是央行在2024年推出的工具，证券、基金和保险公司可以用手里的资产从央行换来国债等更容易卖出的资产。",
      "en": "The official said the CSRC, together with other departments, has used two of the central bank's structural monetary policy tools. So far, securities companies and fund companies have carried out a third batch of \"swap facility\" operations worth 100 billion yuan, used to support listed companies in buying back and increasing holdings of their own shares. The swap facility is a tool the central bank launched in 2024: securities, fund and insurance companies can use assets they hold to swap for assets that are easier to sell, such as government bonds, from the central bank."
    },
    {
      "zh": "他还表示，今年新公布的回购计划、实际回购的金额，以及回购后注销的股份，都达到了历史最高水平。",
      "en": "He also said that this year the newly announced buyback plans, the actual amount bought back, and the shares cancelled after buybacks have all reached their highest levels in history."
    },
    {
      "zh": "下一步，证监会将完善稳定市场的机制，增加股票类产品，引导主动管理的ETF更快买入股票，并让更多中长期资金进入市场。",
      "en": "Next, the CSRC will improve its mechanism for keeping the market stable, add more stock-based products, guide actively managed ETFs to buy shares faster, and let more medium- and long-term money enter the market."
    }
  ],
